---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Attractions Near Lake View Park Islamabad"
  description="Attractions near Lake View Park Islamabad worth combining: Rawal Dam, Shakarparian, Pakistan Monument, Daman-e-Koh, Faisal Mosque and Margalla Hills."
  path="/nearby-attractions/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What can I combine with Lake View Park?', a: 'Rawal Dam and Rawal Lake viewpoints, Shakarparian and the Pakistan Monument, Daman-e-Koh, Faisal Mosque and the Margalla Hills are all within reach. Each needs its own access, hours and route check.' },
    { q: 'How far are these from the park?', a: 'Distance and travel time vary with traffic and your route. Treat them as separate visits to plan, not a combined ticket or timetable.' },
    { q: 'Are Daman-e-Koh or Faisal Mosque family-friendly?', a: 'Both are popular, but each has its own terrain, crowds and access — confirm suitability and timing for your group rather than assuming.' },
    { q: 'Do I need a separate plan for each?', a: 'Yes. Use each destination’s own current information for admission and hours; this page is a planning prompt, not a combined booking.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Nearby attractions', href: '/nearby-attractions/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Rawal Lake guide', href: '/rawal-lake-guide/' },
    { label: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' },
    { label: 'Islamabad family parks', href: '/islamabad-family-parks/' },
    { label: 'Half-day itinerary', href: '/half-day-itinerary/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Lake View Park sits within easy reach of several Islamabad highlights. These are suggestions for a combined day — each place needs its own access, hours and route check.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Close and natural</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li><strong><a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/rawal-lake-and-dam/">Rawal Dam & Rawal Lake viewpoints</a></strong> — the same reservoir the park fronts; different angles, especially at golden hour.</li>
        <li><strong><a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/shakarparian-pakistan-monument/">Shakarparian & Pakistan Monument</a></strong> — a separate CDA-listed green and national monument; check its own admission and timing.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Hills and landmarks</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li><strong><a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/daman-e-koh/">Daman-e-Koh</a></strong> — a higher Margalla Hills vantage point with a different city-and-hills perspective.</li>
        <li><strong><a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/faisal-mosque/">Faisal Mosque</a></strong> — one of Islamabad’s most recognizable landmarks; plan as a separate visit.</li>
        <li><strong><a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/margalla-hills-trail-3-5/">Margalla Hills & trails</a></strong> — separate hiking routes needing their own weather and access assessment.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Each needs its own check</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">Distance and travel time vary with traffic. Verify each destination’s access, hours and route independently; this page is a planning prompt, not a combined ticket or timetable.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Plan each stop separately</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">A combined day works best when you treat each place as its own visit. Confirm access and timing individually, keep the lake as your flexible base, and let traffic and crowds guide how many stops are realistic.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Full guides for each attraction</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Each destination now has its own detailed guide covering the setting, highlights, key facts, hours and admission checks, transport, a numbered route, photo spots, visitor notes and how to combine it with a lake visit. These are independent guides — they do not publish unverified prices, timetables, ratings or business names.</p>
      <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/rawal-lake-and-dam/">Rawal Lake &amp; Rawal Dam →</a></li>
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/faisal-mosque/">Faisal Mosque →</a></li>
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/margalla-hills-trail-3-5/">Margalla Hills &amp; Trail 3/5 →</a></li>
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/shakarparian-pakistan-monument/">Shakarparian &amp; Pakistan Monument →</a></li>
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/daman-e-koh/">Daman-e-Koh →</a></li>
        <li><a class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] card-shadow" href="/centaurus-city-malls/">Centaurus &amp; city malls →</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Nearby attractions checklist" items={[
      'Plan each stop as a separate visit with its own hours.',
      'Verify access and route for each destination.',
      'Keep Rawal Lake and the park as the reliable base.',
      'Allow travel time between stops for traffic.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg" width="1440" height="960" alt="Lakeside structure at Rawal Lake near Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={3} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
